<title>MALAYSIA: BADMINTON-MALAYSIAN OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-MALAYSIAN OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in</p>
<p>the Malaysian Open badminton tournament on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>numbers denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles:</p>
<p>Peter Gate Christiansen (Denmark) beat 5/8 Alan Budi Kusuma</p>
<p>(Indonesia) 18-17 15-11.</p>
<p>5/8 Hermawan Susanto (Indonesia) bt 3/4 Rashid Sidek (Malaysia)</p>
<p>15-5 15-6.</p>
<p>1 Joko Suprianto (Indonesia) bt Luo Yigang (China) 15-10 11-15</p>
<p>18-14.</p>
<p>5/8 Santoso Budi (Indonesia) bt 2 Ong Ewe Hock (Malaysia) 10-15</p>
<p>15-6 15-11.</p>
<p>Women's singles:</p>
<p>1 Ye Zhaoying (China) beat Lee Kyung Won (South Korea) 11-4</p>
<p>11-1.</p>
<p>Zhaou Mi (China) beat Aparna Popat (India) 11-3 11-8.</p>
<p>3/4 Dai Yun (China) beat Yuli Marfuan (Indonesia) 11-1 11-5.</p>
<p>2 Susi Susanti (Indonesia) beat 5/8 Yasuko Mizui (Japan) 11-4</p>
<p>11-4.</p>
</text>
